# 微应用开关：true 开启，false 关闭（包含分享页）；留空沿用非私有部署开启、私有部署关闭。
# Micro apps: true enables, false disables (including share pages); empty keeps the deployment default.
MAGIC_MICRO_APP_ENABLED=""
# Override when the Agent sandbox uses a custom HOME (standard image: /root)
AGENT_USER_HOME_PATH=""
